blockTxChart.query:
GET https://free.rpc.fastnear.com JSON-RPC block(finality=final)
GET https://mainnet.neardata.xyz/v0/block/{finalizedHeight}

Match block identity/hash and each block shard reference to the finalized RPC block. For height_included equal to this block height, require the exact chunk hash and a valid transaction array, then count its transactions. A reference with an earlier height_included contributes zero; its old chunk body is not recounted. A missing or mismatched newly included chunk withholds the total. Retain the raw block references, current-height matched chunks and transaction hashes; full transaction bodies and receipt payloads are discarded. npm run replay -- path/to/evidence.json repeats validation offline.
